AB  - This research paper presents a novel AI-powered educational platform designed to address the significant barriers faced by Indian school dropouts, particularly those from regional language-speaking backgrounds. The platform's core functionality provides personalized learning resources and scholarship recommendations. To optimize the system's retrieval and conversational capabilities, a performance evaluation is conducted on three open-source language models namely all-MiniLM-L6-v2, DistilGPT-2, and Mistral AI. The system incorporates a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) chatbot, implemented with the Gemini API, to deliver interactive, context-aware support. The platform's recommendation accuracy is enhanced by a custom-curated dataset, and PyPDF integration ensures seamless access to digital learning materials. The efficacy of the system is demonstrated through strong performance metrics, including a response relevance of 87%, a retrieval accuracy of 89%, and a low latency of 1 second. These results highlight the platform's potential to empower students to resume their education and access vital financial aid.
